      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's still a problem. When you click \"Hide avatar globally\" on somebody's giant mushroom fallback, it looks like it's working at first, because it turns into a gray robot, but it's actually not. Other instances of this fallback are not hidden, and when you rejoin the instance, it will be shown again. But their main avatar will be saved as hidden instead.",
