  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My primary use case for Hide Avatar Globally is to hide obnoxious Public fallback avatars (giant mushroom, 8 ball, big orange cat, Keiro, etc, etc, etc)\nHide Avatar Globally does not work. This is true whether you try doing \"Hide Avatar Globally\" on somebody wearing the fallback, or whether you do \"Hide Avatar Globally\" on somebody wearing that avatar as their Main.",
